  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "codingcl-streams",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCodingCL \u2014 Continual-Learning Code Benchmark Streams\n\t\n\nFive chronologically-ordered task streams mined from the merge histories of major\nLLM-infrastructure repos. Each stream is a strongly-coupled chain (uses-symbol WCC)\nof functional-capability tasks \u2014 the continual-learning core of the repo.\nEach task provides:\n\nstatement \u2014 a detailed functional requirement (background + typed signatures +\nnumbered behavioral spec + worked-examples truth table), not \"apply this diff\".\ntest_code\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/lwaekfjlk/codingcl-streams.",
